hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1664","Muhammad bin Aziz narrated to us, stating that Salamah bin Ruh narrated to them, who said: Aqil narrated to me, and Ibn Shihab said: 'Ata' bin Abi Rabah narrated to me, that Jabir bin Abdullah (RA) reported that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \Whoever eats garlic or onions should keep away from us"","" or keep away from our mosque"","" and sit in his house.\"""""""
